## Transparent FSM example with a tuple payload.

use Std.Fsm

fsm Turnstile with Tuple(Int, Int)
  Locked --coin--> Unlocked
    update %[data.1 + 1, data.2]
  Unlocked --push--> Locked
    update %[data.1, data.2 + 1]
  Unlocked --coin--> Unlocked
    update %[data.1 + 1, data.2]
  Locked --push--> Locked
